https://docs.github.com/en/webhooks/webhook-events-and-payloads#workflow_run — shape of the documented workflow_run webhook payload (action completed), trimmed (owner, license and url-only members removed); values invented, not a capture. Headers X-GitHub-Event: workflow_run, X-GitHub-Delivery: <uuid>, X-Hub-Signature-256: sha256=<hex>. PROVISIONAL until a real delivery replaces it.
